===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To [[shake]] in a [[trembling]] manner.
# {{lb|en|intransitive}} To use the [[voice]] in a [[trembling]] manner, as in speaking or singing.
#* {{quote-journal|en|date=11 Dec 82|volume=10|number=21|journal=Gay Community News|page=12|title=The Joys of Community ''or'' Holiday-itis Strikes Back|author=Andrea Loewenstein|text="Aw come on, guys!" The woman, clearly overwhelmed by the force of the two friends' personalities, '''quavered''' on the point of tears.}}
# {{lb|en|transitive}} To utter quaveringly.
#* {{RQ:Spectator|III|205|25 October 1711|passage=We shall hear her '''quavering''' them {{...}} to some sprightly airs of the opera.}}

